{"tmdb":1590677,"tagline":"","synopsis":"Putri had run away from home about a year prior. When she was finally found by her mother, Mak Elli, and her younger sister, Alana, Putri was ill following childbirth; she had originally fled after becoming pregnant by her boyfriend. Mak Elli insisted that Putri and her baby, Raman, return home to reunite with the family. After moving back, however, Putri’s condition deteriorated, and she passed away. Since then, local residents have complained about sightings of Putri’s wandering spirit, which appears to be lingering as if there is unfinished business.","directors":[{"name":"Rizal Mantovani","id":146014}],"cast":[{"actor":"Kinaryosih","role":"Mak Elli","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/3hDN8nDtZrJfGjk9cdsnVKhXkHU.jpg","tmdb":1157495},{"actor":"Kawai Labiba","role":"Ananda Rizki Saputri","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xXjPDuDUlhc112SzV5P7EeoHKk7.jpg","tmdb":2251141},{"actor":"Denisha","role":"Alana","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/5BXSGWZreE96vAV9BtgHB8QoHDq.jpg","tmdb":4424065},{"actor":"Fadi Alaydrus","role":"Wira","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/q4E41bJVBP7lhKv6mkaEWpNwLGy.jpg","tmdb":3814943},{"actor":"Fatimah Habsy","role":"Agnes","photo":null,"tmdb":5904311},{"actor":"Arjuna Ghany Setiawan","role":"Raman","photo":null,"tmdb":6470159},{"actor":"Moh Iqbal Sulaiman","role":"Heri","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/yqNXl0D93Sl8KOrPFhkZfhgOmH3.jpg","tmdb":2435471},{"actor":"Bintang Agara","role":"Taufik","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/iHu1vWEfDZoLQi3ApRmG8RdWrpy.jpg","tmdb":3927922},{"actor":"Mirza Ali","role":"Didin","photo":null,"tmdb":5908194},{"actor":"Matacha Parengkuan","role":"Nindy","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8jKnLXYQxfJhF3MUmdFZlGcRAYA.jpg","tmdb":5908188},{"actor":"Yeyen Lidya","role":"Nila","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/1BjhcmcJGc5D7HH7LlH32Ma4WNa.jpg","tmdb":1823303},{"actor":"Nelly Sukma","role":"Sukma","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/